<title>NETHERLANDS: Van Leer to start unit in Belize.</title>
<headline>Van Leer to start unit in Belize.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Packagings maker Van Leer said on Monday it had started production of steel drums in the Central American country of Belize.</p>
<p>Van Leer said it had set up the new unit at the request of its largest customer in this area, The Citrus Company of Belize. Up to now, this client was supplied by Van Leer's Jamaican plant.</p>
<p>The new Belize unit is expected to start with annual turnover of about eight million guilders, Van Leer said.</p>
